    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STAR: You know...the reason why we’re acting a little funny about this couch is... we really love it.\nBARB: It's kind of our couch. We sit on this couch every day. It's our talking couch, you know?",
      "STAR: Okay, well here’s the real story. This couch is packed full of maggots.\nBARB: And flies. They hatched and they’re in there flying around in the cushions with other fly eggs that haven’t hatched yet. You’ll be able to h…",
      "STAR: Two separate ladies have passed away on this couch.\nBARB: And their spirits are in this couch cause this couch has moved by itself and I’ve heard moaning. A lady moaning in it at night.",
      "STAR: Well I always come in when Barb's working and she does the same. Don't worry, you're not paying double.\nBARB: Oh, I thought you were the one working today.\nSTAR/BARB: No! Oh well, that's funny/ It's not the first time!",
      "STAR: Severance? We don't wanna be severanced!\nBARB: Please this job is our lives! It's our purpose! Where are we going to host Thanksgiving?"
    ]
  },
